FROM cs-sonnet
# Context window — raised 2026-08-28. The earlier "6144-16384 regressions
# (35-60s+ responses)" ceiling was measured on the OLD 7.8GB-RAM CPU-serving
# hardware, since replaced by a 48GB A40 GPU pod (see Modelfile.cs-opus's
# 2026-08-23 note). cs-opus's own real benchmark
# (training/benchmark_context_window.js) measured FLAT throughput from 8192
# up to 65536 on this pod, zero degradation. cs-sonnet is smaller/faster
# than cs-opus, so 16384 -- real room for full-CV/document features
# (careerlm-long) that were previously capped to the same 4K ceiling as
# short tasks -- carries real margin. Re-run that benchmark against
# cs-sonnet directly before pushing further.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
# Large batch for fast prefill
PARAMETER num_batch 512
# Full GPU offload — 2B fits in 4GB VRAM
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
# Temperature — balanced for career advice quality
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
# Lower repeat penalty — 2B is smart enough not to loop
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.08
# More output tokens — this is where we beat the defaults
PARAMETER num_predict 4096
PARAMETER stop "<|end|>"
PARAMETER stop "[DONE]"
